{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f","title":"Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 是什么：它能把长期记忆写好到什么程度？","date":"2026-10-16","updated":"2026-10-16","summary":"腾讯混元开放长期记忆写入模型，先看它解决什么、成绩如何、怎样验收。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/wordmark-wide-09c3da7710b8.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy-Memory-30B-A3B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>聊天助手记住你的偏好，难点不只是“存下来”，而是决定哪些信息值得留、怎样写得准确，以及新信息出现后怎样更新旧记录。腾讯混元的 Hy-Memory-30B-A3B，专门处理的就是这条“写入长期记忆”路径。</p>\n<h2>它不是整套聊天模型，而是记忆系统里的“写入员”</h2>\n<p>官方把 Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 定义为紧凑的长期记忆写入模型，约有 3B 激活参数。它可以替换 Mem0、MemOS 和 Hy-Memory 内原本负责写入的通用大模型，覆盖聊天、工作与编程场景。</p>\n<p>可以把外部记忆框架想成快递仓库：对话是不断送来的包裹，记忆库是货架，写入模型负责判断哪些包裹该入库、标签该怎么写、同一件事有了新版本后该替换还是补充。Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 管的是这一步，不是独自完成检索、回答和整套应用流程。</p>\n<p>名称中的 30B 对应模型页面列出的参数规模，实际处理一次输入时约激活 3B 参数。它更像一座有很多货架、每次只调动相关区域的仓库；这能说明模型采用稀疏激活思路，但不能直接推出某台电脑的速度、内存占用或可运行性。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-1-9ff975e4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b6260b59aa90e785c5d73208-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b6260b59aa90e785c5d73208-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-1-9ff975e4.png\" alt=\"官方模型介绍\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>官方成绩能说明什么</h2>\n<p>这次评估只更换记忆写入模型。官方称，各组比较保持框架版本、提示词、检索配置、回答模型、裁判模型和其他框架组件不变；每个写入模型都从空白状态建立自己的记忆库，测试样本与评分规则相同。主评测使用固定 20% 子样本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官方列出的记忆写入模型</th>\n<th>Mem0</th>\n<th>Hy-Memory</th>\n<th>MemOS</th>\n<th>EverMemOS</th>\n<th>综合成绩</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hy-Memory-30B-A3B</td>\n<td>54.02</td>\n<td>60.55</td>\n<td>50.51</td>\n<td>56.89</td>\n<td>55.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Opus 5</td>\n<td>53.43</td>\n<td>60.53</td>\n<td>50.50</td>\n<td>54.04</td>\n<td>54.62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash</td>\n<td>49.73</td>\n<td>60.20</td>\n<td>49.17</td>\n<td>55.47</td>\n<td>53.64</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>官方固定 20% 子样本结果；各框架成绩由六项指标等权平均，综合成绩再对四个框架等权平均。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这些数字支持一个有限结论：在官方固定条件与抽样矩阵中，Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 的综合成绩为 55.49。它们不是独立复测，也不能证明换一套提示词、检索器、回答模型或真实用户数据后仍有相同结果。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-2-f852ef54.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/fa1b4f402e623087588af1e0-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/fa1b4f402e623087588af1e0-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-2-f852ef54.png\" alt=\"官方评测条件\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>更值得看的，是它怎样学习更新记忆</h2>\n<p>官方采用两阶段训练：先进行 Memory On-Policy Distillation，让学生模型学习教师提供的状态链；再进行 Attributed Memory Reinforcement Learning，根据形成的记忆库分配分块级反馈，并把选中的记忆库带入后续窗口。</p>\n<p>这像整理微信聊天记录：先学习怎样把零散消息写成清楚的备忘，再根据后续使用效果判断哪些记录真正有用。关键不只是记住一句话，而是让旧记录在新证据出现时继续可用。官方还把 EverMemOS 留在训练之外，用它观察模型迁移到未见过记忆框架时的表现。</p>\n<h2>现在能拿到什么，还缺什么</h2>\n<p>官方模型页已经列出模型权重、配置与模型卡，并提供 <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B\">Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 模型页面</a>。文件采用 Safetensors，页面标注 BF16 与 F32；这说明权重已经提供，不是只展示未来计划。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方给出的部署方式是 vLLM，注明测试版本为 v0.31.0，并通过兼容 OpenAI 的接口调用。</li>\n<li>官方同时提供框架代码与评估工具入口，适合继续核对数据格式、记忆库结构和评测方法。</li>\n<li>模型页面明确显示当前没有 Inference Provider 部署，因此不能把“权重已开放”理解成“已有托管接口可以直接点用”。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-3-0c37a814.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/8b9e995c19682c8c15454ca0-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/8b9e995c19682c8c15454ca0-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-3-0c37a814.png\" alt=\"官方部署说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告</strong>\n权重可下载只解决了“文件能不能拿到”。许可证是否满足具体用途、运行时是否兼容、硬件是否装得下、真实任务能否稳定工作，仍要分别核实；官方资料没有给出普通消费级设备的内存、速度或成本结论。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-4-39e8a1fd.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/85a4a5563e2cce8deb3c8388-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/85a4a5563e2cce8deb3c8388-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-10-16-official-6b1fdcbd2e4f/source-evidence-4-39e8a1fd.png\" alt=\"托管服务状态\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>真正准备使用时，按一条完整链路验收</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>先确认任务确实需要跨对话保留用户事实、偏好或项目状态，而不是只需要当前上下文。</li>\n<li>再按官方框架固定回答模型与检索配置，只替换记忆写入模型，避免把其他组件的变化算到它头上。</li>\n<li>保留空库开始、写入结果、更新后的记忆库和最终回答，检查模型有没有漏记、误记或把推断当事实。</li>\n<li>最后加入真实的删除、纠错和偏好变化场景。能写入一次不等于能长期维护，更不等于整套助手已经可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hy-Memory-30B-A3B 的价值很明确：它把长期记忆系统里容易被通用模型兼任的写入环节，单独做成了可替换模型。现阶段适合已有外部记忆框架、愿意自己部署并做逐项验收的开发者；只想直接获得托管聊天服务，或期待权重下载后立即在任意电脑运行的人，还需要等待更完整的运行条件与独立实测。</p>\n<h2>官方资料</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Memory-30B-A3B\">腾讯混元 官方发布说明</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967","slug":"2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967","legacyPaths":[],"title":"DeepSeek Harness支持多代理协作后，现有项目该不该升级？","date":"2026-11-11","updated":"2026-11-11","summary":"新预发布版补上协作与审阅功能，但工作树清理、搜索配置和工具授权更值得升级前检查。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967/wordmark-wide-1d2d78458d81.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967/wordmark-wide-1d2d78458d81.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"v0.2.2-rc.2","discoveryCategory":"AI应用/行业","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/releases/tag/dsh-v0.2.2-rc.2","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-10-official-6f0d2e1f6cd9","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-10-official-6f0d2e1f6cd9","slug":"2026-11-10-official-6f0d2e1f6cd9","legacyPaths":[],"title":"MiniMax-H3-Image-PE 能直接画图吗？先分清描述扩写与图像生成","date":"2026-11-10","updated":"2026-11-10","summary":"MiniMax-H3-Image-PE 能直接画图吗？先分清描述扩写与图像生成","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-10-official-6f0d2e1f6cd9/w